          "filename": "Beech AT-11 Kansan (8919664259).jpg",
          "caption": "This Beech AT-11 Kansan (ZK-AHO) was built in 1937 and was used first by the RNZAF as a training aircraft. In 1943 it was taken over by New Zealand Aerial Mapping Limited and played a major role in the mapping of the whole country. It was retired in 1980 and still retains its original paint.",
